translations: ['You, Harsh Baby of Kwangtung?', 'children whose lectures in the baskets above the propagation in Sierras and stretched dynamite into the starch in the rock?', 'I want you just to turn you into a flour on the wall.', 'your predecessor now turns in the graves.', 'you push me too much on me.', "I'm not a slave. I'm not a slave.", 'I agreed as a protector.', 'I was with a shocking shocking.', "I'm sending the house a little money less.", 'I have no  ⁇ as to eat.', ' ⁇ asto evil is my  ⁇ asto evil.', "if I die, I'm going to fuck.", ', my family will be fucked.', '? And do you know?', 'what do you mean? What do you mean? What do you mean?', ', however, none of the interested parties had submitted an alternative to the interested party.', 'The revision is based on the adjusted capacity data provided by the applicant and covering the entire Union industry.', 'The revised data are accompanied by reference to publicly available data relating to unused capacities and capacity of producers who have stopped operations due to financial difficulties.', 'as explained in Section 6 ‘Makroeconomic indicators’, revised data provide a much more precise set of capacity data available for biofuels during the period considered than the data originally supplied and published in the provisional Regulation.', 'each error is erroneous. Each error is mistaken.', "you know what it's like? Do you know what it's like?", "you've got a lot of salt for heavy sins, you've got a lot.", 'you can see little for light sins for the light sins.', 'do you understand? Do you understand?', 'that man killed a boy and I helped him to help him.', 'I was happy. I was happy. I was happy.', 'forgive me this.', 'you need to go to work!', 'Geum-jao, what do those eye shadows mean?', 'you know why those kids... why the kids...', ', hey!', "here is another! Here's another!", 's Hello?', '[5] Communication from the Commission to the European Parliament, the Council, the European Economic and Social Committee and the Committee of the Regions: the Digital Agenda for Europe, COM(2010) 245 final, 28.8.2010.', 'Study in Europe Erasmus and programme Leonardo da Vinci European Commission Homepage News Transport and Travel Energy and Natural Resources of the EU Economic, Finance and Taxes, Education and Youth Business Regions and Local Development Justice and Civil Rights Science and Technology Employment and Social Rights Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Environment, Consumer Protection and Health Study and Health Environment?', "Yo, you don't want to see a sticker, shit.", 'duplicate deposit? Do you have a document?', 'now get out of here now. Now get out.', 'the house is not on the sale.', 'so what was it? What was it? What was it?', 'was this... experience of experience?', 'Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.', ', it was certainly the experience of experience.', 'What is it like stink? What is it like stink?', 'Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.', "... secret Navaj's flowers and...", 'is it all right?', 'not. No. No.', 'even not. Not even not.', ', indeed, not even at all.', ': Application of EU legislation Answer from the Council (3 November 2009)', 'was only a test...', ', Samah watched Xara with a wristful prosper in his eyes.', 'that was all. It was all.', 'examination of the test.', 'was to teach you the humility and patience.', 'was to mitigate your aggressiveity..."', '," Xar said quietly.', '," said Samah and slowly bowed his head.', 'weaken you are weakened."', 'you were afraid of us."', 'We were afraid of you we were afraid of you."', 'you hoped that we die..."', 'not."', ', Samah shook his head.', 'Labyrint became a prolongation of this hope.', 'is nothing larger or older than the universe.', 'I would like to talk about the following questions:', 'We are alone in the Universe in the Universe? Are we ourselves in space?', ', pursuant to Articles 46 EC and 55 EC, Articles 43 EC and 49 EC do not preclude restrictions justifying public health reasons.', "I'm saying what I heard. I've heard.", 'they heard the other cops.', ', that means that Ko ⁇ á ⁇ i ⁇ í will go to me after me.', 'damn it, damn it.', "that's to get the backup.", "I don't have anything to do with Freeb, just help you. And nobody knows it, except cops.", ', did they go on to me? Did they go on to me?', 'every person has someone. Every person has someone.', ', do you want me to leave?', "that you told me that I'd leave, -this will not help.", "I'm going to take it away.", 'so I should go. So I should go.', 'the glory.', 'and you watch your tongue.', 'Naser, Naser himself.', 'Come here to sit down here!', 'I have no time. I have no time.', 'Come with me! Come with me!', "you're going to eat later.", "Come! Let's go!", "don't go into me or I'll give you sexes.", ", Oswald, watch who's here!", 'no one can walk behind him.', 'but how?But how? How?', 'what are you doing here? What are you doing here?', 'I teach you to listen to you I will teach you to listen!', 'outside!', 'always, he always stands up.', 'Where is Dana? Where is Dana?', 'he is on the roof.']
